      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok so it's probably not phosphorus then. but i was looking at some of the patches and they almost look like someone or something has been nibbling or disturbing the soil? it just looks really patchy and uneven in a weird way. besides the nutrients, is there anything else that usually causes these kind of sudden, strange gaps in a yard?",
